&lt;p>Sensor、Signal Chain、Power Management。三个普通的工程词汇，背后却是一个复杂的技术世界。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>纳芯微：与客户积极推进价格调整</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/q5sazdvjxhuudx7nhuqfcg/</link><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:22:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/q5sazdvjxhuudx7nhuqfcg/</guid><description>&lt;p>纳芯微上半年营收25.4亿，同比+66.73%；归母净利6759万，去年同期还亏7801万，直接扭亏。二季度营收14亿、净利1.03亿，单季也盈利了。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>纳芯微电流传感器：车上要测大电流，为什么还要盯着发热？</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-x5luzjmof5xzbglbtrpmdg/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:14:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-x5luzjmof5xzbglbtrpmdg/</guid><description>&lt;p>电动汽车的车载充电机和直流变换器，需要知道电流正在怎样变化。测量结果既关系到控制，也关系到过流保护；但传感器如果自身发热过多，又会给系统增加负担。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>